   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Los planos paralelos son \\(2x+y-2z+D=0\\). La distancia entre dos planos paralelos es<i class='n' data-t='th'>Distancia entre planos paralelos \\(Ax+By+Cz+D_1=0\\) y \\(Ax+By+Cz+D_2=0\\): \\(\\frac{|D_1-D_2|}{\\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}\\) (la distancia de un punto cualquiera de uno al otro).</i> \\(\\dfrac{|D-(-2)|}{\\sqrt{4+1+4}}=\\dfrac{|D+2|}3=2\\iff D+2=\\pm6\\iff D=4\\) o \\(D=-8\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":35,\"el\":10,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.194,1.55,0.969],[2.357,-0.775,0.969],[0.806,-1.55,-0.969],[-0.357,0.775,-0.969]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.806,-1.55,-0.969],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[-0.14,0.884,2.302],[1.023,-1.442,2.302],[-0.527,-2.217,0.364],[-1.69,0.109,0.364]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"txt\",[-0.527,-2.217,0.364],\"π₁\",\"#b45309\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[2.527,2.217,-0.364],[3.69,-0.109,-0.364],[2.14,-0.884,-2.302],[0.977,1.442,-2.302]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"txt\",[2.14,-0.884,-2.302],\"π₂\",\"#b45309\",4,0],[\"line\",[-0.333,-0.667,1.333],[2.333,0.667,-1.333],\"#16a34a\",1.8,true],[\"vec\",[1,0,0],[1.8,0.4,-0.8],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"Q\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-0.333,-0.667,1.333],\"Q₁\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.333,0.667,-1.333],\"Q₂\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 358 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n523n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n523d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n523g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n523r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='158.1,95.4 36.4,92.3 48.4,168.6 170.2,171.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='52.4' y='168.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><polygon points='168.5,21.1 46.7,18.0 58.7,94.3 180.5,97.4' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='62.7' y='94.3' fill='#b45309' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₁</text><polygon points='147.8,169.7 26.0,166.6 38.0,242.9 159.8,246.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.0' y='242.9' fill='#b45309' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₂</text><line x1='113.6' y1='57.7' x2='92.9' y2='206.3' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='103.3' y1='132.0' x2='97.0' y2='176.6' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#n523n)'/><text x='101.0' y='172.6' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><circle cx='103.3' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='111.3' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>Q</text><circle cx='113.6' cy='57.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='120.6' y='51.7' font-weight='700'>Q₁</text><circle cx='92.9' cy='206.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='99.9' y='200.3' font-weight='700'>Q₂</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.8' y2='272.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.6' y='277.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.1' y2='271.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='38.7' y='276.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(199.4,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(302.9,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(2x+y-2z+4=0\\) y \\(2x+y-2z-8=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cortes de \\(\\pi\\) con los ejes: \\(X(1,0,0)\\), \\(Y(0,2,0)\\), \\(Z(0,0,-1)\\). El tetraedro \\(OXYZ\\) tiene tres aristas perpendiculares en \\(O\\) de longitudes 1, 2 y 1. Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='