 cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{OX},\\overrightarrow{OY},\\overrightarrow{OZ}]=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&2&0\\\\0&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-2+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\]\\[V=\\frac16\\bigl|[\\overrightarrow{OX},\\overrightarrow{OY},\\overrightarrow{OZ}]\\bigr|=\\frac16\\,|-2|=\\frac26\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":40,\"el\":10,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,0,0],[0,2,0],[0,0,-1]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[1,0,0],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,2,0],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,0,-1],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",-14,-6],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"X(1,0,0)\",-20,16],[\"pt\",[0,2,0],\"Y(0,2,0)\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,-1],\"Z(0,0,−1)\",7,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 202' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n524n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n524d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n524g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n524r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='26.0,35.6 314.0,47.6 111.1,148.4' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='111.1' y1='18.0' x2='26.0' y2='35.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='111.1' y1='18.0' x2='314.0' y2='47.6' stroke='#64748b' 