  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-1-8",
   "n": 8,
   "bloque": "B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\equiv x=1-y=z\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y-3z=4\\\\3x-y+z=-2\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Estudia la posición relativa de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(s\\) y es paralelo a \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>\\(r\\):</b> \\(x=t\\), \\(y=1-t\\), \\(z=t\\): punto \\(R(0,1,0)\\) y dirección \\(\\vec d_r=(1,-1,1)\\). <b>\\(s\\):</b> dirección \\(\\vec d_s=(1,1,-3)\\times(3,-1,1)=(-2,-10,-4)\\sim(1,5,2)\\); un punto (con \\(z=0\\): \\(x+y=4\\), \\(3x-y=-2\\)): \\(S\\left(\\frac12,\\frac72,0\\right)\\).</p><p>Las direcciones no son proporcionales: no son paralelas ni coincidentes. ¿Se cortan? Producto mixto de \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=\\left(\\frac12,\\frac52,0\\right)\\), \\(\\vec d_r\\) y \\(\\vec d_s\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Dos rectas con direcciones no proporcionales son coplanarias (se cortan) si \\([\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]=0\\); si no, se cruzan.</i>. Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]=\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac12&\\frac52&0\\\\1&-1&1\\\\1&5&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-1+\\frac{5}{2}+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+\\frac{5}{2}+5\\bigr)\\]\\[=-6\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>Las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan (no son coplanarias)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(s\\) (por \\(S\\), con dirección \\(\\vec d_s\\)) y es paralelo a \\(r\\) (con dirección \\(\\vec d_r\\)): su normal es perpendicular a ambas:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d_s\\times\\vec d_r=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&5&2\\\\1&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(7,\\,1,\\,-6)\\]\\[7x+y-6z+D=0\\ \\text{por }S\\left(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac72,0\\right):\\ \\tfrac72+\\tfrac72+D=0\\Rightarrow D=-7\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":25,\"el\":10,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.25,0.419,-2.555],[0.234,7.841,0.413],[2.25,6.581,2.555],[0.766,-0.841,-0.413]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"line\",[0.05,1.25,-0.9],[0.95,5.75,0.9],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.95,5.75,0.9],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.6,4.0,0.2],[0.837,5.187,0.675],\"#16a34a\",\"dₛ\",4,-4],[\"line\",[-1.4,2.4,-1.4],[1.4,-0.4,1.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.4,-0.4,1.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.3,0.7,0.3],[0.993,0.007,0.993],\"#16a34a\",\"dᵣ\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0.25,2.25,-0.5],[1.307,2.401,-1.406],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[0.5,3.5,0],\"S\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,0],\"R\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 215' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='g3n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='g3d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='g3g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='g3r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='97.0,161.4 3